cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "uav-rf-jammer-fdtd: FDTD simulation of a portable 2.4 GHz RF jammer and its coupling into a UAV link antenna"
abstract: >-
  openEMS FDTD simulation of four jammer antenna front-ends (bare whip, whip with corner reflector, TSA600 Vivaldi,
  and TSA600 with corner reflector) and their coupling into a 2.4 GHz UAV Wi-Fi antenna. Simulation work of the UREP
  project "Design and Optimization of a Portable Electromagnetic Gun for Targeted RF Signal Suppression"
  (UREP 32-0123-250016), Qatar University.
authors:
  - family-names: "FAMILY NAME"
    given-names: "GIVEN NAME"
    affiliation: "Qatar University"
